Cell["\<\
The most complex case: GW with a general plus polarization p and cross \
polarisation x rotated \[Alpha] degrees about the x-axis and then \[Phi] \
degrees about the z-axis.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.9481186039827137`*^9, 3.948118690564567*^9}, {
   3.948134711980591*^9, 3.9481347168592567`*^9}, 
